<title>UK: Petrobras sets two bonds total $375 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobras sets two bonds total $375 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleo Brasileiro SA (Petrobras) has launched a two-tranche bond for $375 million with five- and 10-year maturities, lead manager Chase said. </p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE ONE</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     8.75 PCT  MATURITY    17.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.88     PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50 PCT  REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	+250 BP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE TWO</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     10.0 PCT  MATURITY    17.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.78     PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75 PCT  REOFFER    99.78     SPREAD	+350 BP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
